flowchart LR
    Browser["React dashboard<br/>Upload, status, history, report<br/>localStorage: job ID + theme"]
    Proxy["Vite /api proxy"]
    Gateway["Floci API Gateway<br/>HTTP API"]

    Create["Create Job Lambda<br/>POST /jobs"]
    Jobs["Job read Lambdas<br/>GET /jobs<br/>GET /jobs/{job_id}"]
    Result["Result Lambda<br/>GET /jobs/{job_id}/result"]

    Input["S3 input bucket<br/>serverless-csv-input<br/>uploads/{job_id}/input.csv"]
    Queue["SQS standard queue<br/>serverless-csv-processing"]
    Worker["Process CSV Lambda<br/>validate + aggregate"]
    Table["DynamoDB jobs table<br/>serverless-csv-jobs<br/>status + metadata"]
    Reports["S3 results bucket<br/>serverless-csv-results<br/>results/{job_id}/report.json"]

    Browser -->|HTTP /api| Proxy --> Gateway
    Gateway --> Create
    Gateway --> Jobs
    Gateway --> Result
    Create -->|conditional UPLOAD_PENDING insert| Table
    Create -->|presigned PUT URL| Browser
    Browser -->|direct signed PUT| Input
    Input -->|ObjectCreated:Put| Queue -->|event source mapping| Worker
    Worker -->|claim / complete / fail| Table
    Worker -->|JSON report| Reports
    Jobs -->|read| Table
    Result -->|check COMPLETED| Table
    Result -->|read JSON| Reports

    %% UPLOAD_PENDING -> PROCESSING -> COMPLETED or FAILED.
    %% Duplicate SQS deliveries are handled by conditional claims and an expiring lease.
    %% DLQ, EventBridge, SNS, and audit processing are not implemented.
